# Landing-site headers.
#
# scripts/compose-site.cjs merges this with the Unity build's rules (rewritten
# under /play) into ONE root _headers, because Netlify reads only the root file.
# The site's broad rules go first so the game's specific ones win on overlap.
#
# CSP IS DELIBERATELY ABSENT. Blueprint Phase 7 owns it, and §8.1 requires it to
# ship in report-only first: enforcing an unmeasured policy over a Unity WebGL
# payload is how you publish a blank page. The headers below cannot break a
# working page, so they land now.
/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=(), payment=(), usb=()
